# EAS Build archives the whole git repo root by default (this is a
# monorepo - auto-layout/ is the app, model/, server/, FUNCTIONS/ are
# siblings under the same repo but irrelevant to an Android/iOS build).
#
# IMPORTANT (per https://github.com/expo/fyi/blob/main/eas-build-archive.md):
# once this file exists, EAS CLI stops respecting *any* .gitignore file -
# node_modules/ etc. are normally excluded via auto-layout/.gitignore, but
# with .easignore present that's no longer automatic and has to be listed
# here explicitly, or it gets archived too. (.git itself is always excluded
# regardless of .easignore, so no entry needed for that.)
model/
server/
FUNCTIONS/
images/
*.md

# Mirrors auto-layout/.gitignore, which no longer applies once this file exists.
**/node_modules/
.expo/
dist/
web-build/
